  "description": "Our MTB Sport WSD is the perfect entry-level bike for anyone looking to get into the world of Mountain biking, without breaking the bank. Built to tackle anything from mountain trails to the hilly urban commute, you’ll be riding in ease on this confidence-inspiring MTB.\nThe MTB Sport WSD is an ideal first mountain bike. You can set it up as a tough commuter, an off-road tourer or an all-day adventure bike for epic gravel grinding rides. The aluminium frame has proven cross-country geometry to get you moving fast on the single track. The upright, endurance-oriented position means that you can cruise in comfort as well.\nThe 21-speed Shimano Tourney running gear and Promax V-brakes mean that it has the reliability, speed, braking power and control. The super-low low gear lets you climb any mountain. Switch up through the gear range and you’ll have the speed to tackle the traffic as well.",
